             description: "Seven YAML files hold the clip on. Six of them are copies of each other with one space changed."),
            (name: "Tactical Keyboard of Hot Reloading", icon: "gear_keyboard", slot: Keyboard, rarity: Rare, ilvl: 8, role: Some(Melee),
             visual: (color: (0.9, 0.3, 0.6), style: 3),
